flowchart TB
    OUT[Secure Outcomes\nSafe | Trusted | Compliant | Resilient | Expected]
    HC[Human Controller / Clinical or Business Owner]
    AG[Regulated Healthcare Agent]
    QMS[Quality Management System\nDesign controls, CAPA, change control]
    RM[Risk Management\nHazards, harms, risk controls]
    ATF[Agent Trust Fabric\nAssess mission, goal, context, risk, behavior, evidence]
    PDP[Ring 2 PDP / PEP\nPolicy enforcement, approval gates]
    DATA[Regulated Data + Knowledge Sources\nClinical, product, quality, service data]
    TOOLS[Approved Tools / Medical Product Workflows / APIs]
    VAL[Ring 3 Validation\nGoal integrity, safety constraints, adversarial testing]
    EVID[Evidence Package\nAudit trail, validation, traceability, assurance]
    GOV[Governance, Telemetry and Assurance\nPolicy, compliance, evidence review]
    RESP[Runtime Response\nConstrain, pause, rollback, recover, re-establish]

    HC --> AG
    QMS --> GOV
    RM --> GOV
    AG --> ATF
    ATF --> PDP
    PDP --> DATA
    PDP --> TOOLS
    DATA --> VAL
    TOOLS --> VAL
    VAL --> EVID
    EVID --> GOV
    GOV --> PDP
    PDP --> RESP
    RESP --> OUT
    GOV --> OUT
